  "description": "The application is to match the neighbouring property at No8-10 Grosvenor Gardens and install a DDA accessible lift to the front of the premises, in order to aid access to the building for wheelchair and other disabled users. The current access to the property is via the rear, along a cobbled path (very difficult for wheelchairs), down a car park stairs ramp and into the building. Given the completion of the works at No8-10, we believe the works can be undertaken sympathetically to the listed front elevation of the building. ",
